			"hadithnumber": 3088,
			"arabicnumber": 3088,
			"text": "It was narrated from Ibn ‘Umar that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:“There are five animals, for which there is no sin on a person if he kills them” – or he said: “if he kills them when in Ihram – the scorpion, the crow, the kite, the mouse and the vicious dog.”",
